WEBVTT

00:07:30.738 --> 00:07:36.243
Eventually, he won his legal case
to stay in the United States,

00:07:36.285 --> 00:07:41.749
but not before 650 nights passed.

00:07:43.667 --> 00:07:44.835
And yet ...

00:07:45.503 --> 00:07:47.213
others are not so lucky.

00:07:49.298 --> 00:07:50.424
Kamyar Samimi ...

00:07:51.342 --> 00:07:56.055
had a green card
and 40 years in the United States,

00:07:56.096 --> 00:07:59.433
when one day, ICE showed up at his door

00:07:59.475 --> 00:08:03.020
and took him down to a private prison
in suburban Denver.